- The Battery Holder only interacts with the Electrical System and is housed within the Housing. It does not directly interact with the Bit, Transmission, Motor, or External Environment.
- The Housing interacts with all components as it houses them but does not directly interact with the External Environment.
- The External Environment only interacts with the Bit and Housing (for support).
